There are two reasons for this action that are likely if you didn't
have =oConflict on yourself.

1)  A monster threw a potion of confusion and it hit the winged
gargoyle.  Confused pets may attack you.  Smart pets that can use tools
will pick up and keep unicorns to fix things like confusion.

2)  One of the still hostile monsters was an Umber Hulk.  These are the
monsters that have a confusing gaze attack, which can confuse pets and
then result in your pet attacking you while it is still confused.

The third and unlikely reason at this point would have been confused
from hunger but a new pet shouldn't have this problem.

The worst part about confused pets is they ignore Elbereth completely.

